14772,0x2B479C0,"Try MOVING, JUMPING and STRAFING with the demo presets on the left.
Note that NO ANIMATIONS are used in this demo. Instead, the camera and weapons are manipulated using realtime SPRING PHYSICS, SINUS BOB and NOISE SHAKING.
Combining this with traditional animations (e.g. reload) can be very powerful!"
