14795,0x2B47A78,external forces
14796,0x2B47A80,"The camera and weapon are mounted on 8 positional and angular SPRINGS.
EXTERNAL FORCES can be applied to these in various ways, creating unique movement patterns every time. This is useful for shockwaves, explosion knockback and earthquakes."
