14801,0x2B479A8,part ii: under the hood
14802,0x2B479B0,"Ultimate FPS features a NEXT-GEN first person camera system with ultra smooth PROCEDURAL ANIMATION of player movements. Camera and weapons are manipulated using over 100 parameters, allowing for a vast range of super-lifelike behaviors."
14803,0x2B47AA8,mouse input
14804,0x2B47AB0,"Any good FPS should offer configurable MOUSE SMOOTHING and ACCELERATION.
• Smoothing interpolates mouse input over several frames to reduce jittering.
 • Acceleration + low mouse sensitivity allows high precision without loss of turn speed.
• Click the below buttons to compare some example setups."
