14840,0x2B47BE0,"This level has some basic gameplay features.
• Press SHIFT to SPRINT, C to CROUCH, and the RIGHT MOUSE BUTTON to AIM.
• To SWITCH WEAPONS, press Q, E or 1-3.
• Press R to RELOAD, and F to INTERACT."
